- * arm_vm_init installs a reserved kernel VA alias before removing TTBR0;
- * retain this console until the normal framebuffer serial console is ready.
+ * Pixel 1 bootstrap log. No allocation, locks, ADT parsing or per-CPU state:
+ * panic() can reach this before a current thread exists.
+ *
+ * Text is appended to the Android ramoops console record that the shim
+ * started (shim/pstore.c): after a reset (the shim re-arms the APSS watchdog
+ * before jumping here) Android shows it as /sys/fs/pstore/console-ramoops-0.
+ * start.s maps the 32MB block holding the zone VA=PA as Device memory;
+ * arm_vm_init installs a kernel VA alias before removing TTBR0. Kept until
